  "claim": "Mawson is an electoral district that includes the wine regional around the town, where Mollydooker Wines Pty Ltd is based, south of Adelaide.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Electoral district of Mawson. Sentence: Mawson is an electoral district of the House of Assembly in the Australian state of South Australia.\nPage: Electoral district of Mawson. Sentence: It covers most of the outer southern suburbs of the City of Onkaparinga, including Hackham, Hackham West, Huntfield Heights, Noarlunga Downs, Old Noarlunga, Onkaparinga Hills and Seaford Heights, the regional shopping centre area at Noarlunga Centre, parts of Woodcroft, and the southern wine region around McLaren Vale and Willunga.\nPage: McLaren Vale. Sentence: McLaren Vale is a wine region approximately 35 km south of Adelaide in South Australia.\nPage: Mollydooker Wines. Sentence: Mollydooker Wines Pty Ltd is based in the McLaren Vale Area of Australia.",
