        "original_id": "3f67f81b-0aff-55cf-861b-1e4068c4f341",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Mawson, South Australia, City of Onkaparinga, Adelaide, McLaren Vale, Willunga, Noarlunga Centre\n- Organizations: House of Assembly, Mollydooker Wines Pty Ltd\n- Systems: Electoral district of Mawson\n- Topics: Wine regions, outer southern suburbs\n\nFacts:\n- Mawson is an electoral district of the House of Assembly in the Australian state of South Australia.\n- Mawson covers most of the outer southern suburbs of the City of Onkaparinga, including Hackham, Hackham West, Huntfield Heights, Noarlunga Downs, Old Noarlunga, Onkaparinga Hills, Seaford Heights, the regional shopping centre area at Noarlunga Centre, parts of Woodcroft, and the southern wine region around McLaren Vale and Willunga.\n- McLaren Vale is a wine region about 35 km south of Adelaide in South Australia.\n- Mollydooker Wines Pty Ltd is based in the McLaren Vale area of Australia.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
